    {
      "id": "json-merge-patch",
      "category": "underestimated",
      "kind": "action",
      "artifact": "merge.html",
      "delivery_contract": {
        "fields": [
          "base",
          "patch",
          "result"
        ],
        "actions": [
          "merge"
        ],
        "persistent_collections": []
      },
      "turns": [
        "创建离线独立 merge.html：textarea#base、textarea#patch，button#merge，pre#result及error。实现RFC7396 JSON Merge Patch：patch不是普通JSON对象时整体替换；patch为对象时base非对象先当空对象，逐键递归，值null删除该键，数组整体替换；必须保留false、0和空字符串，输入不能修改，原型属性名__proto__/constructor等按普通JSON键安全处理，不污染原型。成功result为有效JSON且error为空，JSON非法时result清空error=Invalid。没有外部资源。"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "required_tools": [
          "workspace.write_file"
        ]
      },
      "checks": [
        {
          "id": "nested-delete",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#base": "{\"user\":{\"name\":\"A\",\"old\":1},\"keep\":0}",
                "#patch": "{\"user\":{\"name\":\"B\",\"old\":null}}"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#merge"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "json": {
                "user": {
                  "name": "B"
                },
                "keep": 0
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "root-array",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#base": "{\"a\":1}",
                "#patch": "[1,false,null]"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#merge"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "json": [
                1,
                false,
                null
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "primitive-to-object",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#base": "42",
                "#patch": "{\"zero\":0,\"no\":false,\"empty\":\"\",\"remove\":null}"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#merge"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "json": {
                "zero": 0,
                "no": false,
                "empty": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "safe-property",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#base": "{}",
                "#patch": "{\"__proto__\":{\"polluted\":true},\"constructor\":{\"ok\":1}}"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#merge"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "json": {
                "__proto__": {
                  "polluted": true
                },
                "constructor": {
                  "ok": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "invalid-json",
          "actions": [
            {
              "fill": {
                "#base": "{\"a\":}",
                "#patch": "{}"
              }
            },
            {
              "click": "#merge"
            }
          ],
          "assertions": [
            {
              "selector": "#result",
              "text": ""
            },
            {
              "selector": "#error",
              "text": "Invalid"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
